THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
======================

The source code in this repository is Apache-2.0. The following third-party
components are NOT covered by that licence and carry their own terms. They
are downloaded at runtime or used only during training; none of their weights
are redistributed in this repository.

Models fetched from the Hugging Face Hub at first launch
--------------------------------------------------------
  openai/clip-vit-base-patch32                     MIT
  google/flan-t5-small                             Apache-2.0
  nvidia/segformer-b0-finetuned-ade-512-512        NVIDIA Source Code Licence
  nvidia/segformer-b0-finetuned-cityscapes-...     NVIDIA Source Code Licence
  facebook/dinov2-small (training notebook only)   Apache-2.0

  The SegFormer checkpoints are referenced by disabled/experimental code
  paths (USE_SEGMENTATION = False, auto-ROI off by default) and are only
  downloaded if those features are switched on.

Datasets used only for the retraining experiment
------------------------------------------------
