Circuit data
------------
  circuits.json lap_time_s and pit_loss_s values marked "_measured" were
  computed from publicly available timing data via the FastF1 library
  (MIT). Fields marked "_estimated" are typical published figures. Every
  entry records its own provenance.


TRAINING DATA NOT INCLUDED
==========================

The calibrate/ directory referenced throughout the documentation holds
labelled frames captured from race broadcasts. It is excluded from version
control: those frames are third-party broadcast content and are not ours to
redistribute.

backend/app/probe.npz — the trained linear classifier — IS committed. It
contains 1,536 fitted coefficients, not imagery.
